# Ryoku packages that build on aarch64 from Ryoku's own PKGBUILDs: pure data
# (cursors, fonts, oh-my-zsh, blesh, udev rules) and gpk, whose PKGBUILD
# carries the official arm64 binary. gpk and ryoku-oh-my-zsh are hard deps of
# ryoku-desktop. Rebuilt whenever the PKGBUILD's version moves.
ryoku-cursors
ryoku-cursor-material
otf-space-grotesk
ttf-maple-mono-nf
blesh
game-devices-udev
gpk
ryoku-oh-my-zsh
